{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786126752325,"level":"log","data":["Response body:","{\"answer_id\":62,\"total_score\":0,\"scores\":{\"situation\":0,\"task\":0,\"action\":0,\"result\":0},\"strengths\":[],\"improvements\":[\"The candidate provided a completely unhelpful response. This answer demonstrates a lack of self-awareness and an unwillingness to engage with the question's intent. The candidate needs to demonstrate an ability to receive feedback and reflect on their performance.\"],\"feedback\":\"This response is entirely insufficient. The interviewer was seeking an example of how you handle constructive criticism, which you completely avoided addressing. This answer requires significant work.\",\"suggested_answer\":\"\\\"That’s a fair point; I appreciate you bringing that up. Honestly, I haven't always been the best at receiving feedback openly. In a previous role, my manager pointed out that while I was consistently delivering projects on time, my communication with stakeholders could be improved – specifically, I wasn’t proactively updating them on potential roadblocks. Initially, I felt a bit defensive, but I realized they were right and it was impacting team collaboration. So, I started scheduling brief weekly check-ins with key stakeholders to provide updates, even if there weren't any issues. That shift has significantly improved communication and strengthened relationships.\\\"\"}"]}
{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786126752325,"level":"log","data":["STAR evaluation:","{\"answer_id\": 62, \"feedback\": \"This response is entirely insufficient. The interviewer was seeking an example of how you handle constructive criticism, which you completely avoided addressing. This answer requires significant work.\", \"improvements\": [\"The candidate provided a completely unhelpful response. This answer demonstrates a lack of self-awareness and an unwillingness to engage with the question's intent. The candidate needs to demonstrate an ability to receive feedback and reflect on their performance.\"], \"scores\": {\"action\": 0, \"result\": 0, \"situation\": 0, \"task\": 0}, \"strengths\": [], \"suggested_answer\": \"\\\"That’s a fair point; I appreciate you bringing that up. Honestly, I haven't always been the best at receiving feedback openly. In a previous role, my manager pointed out that while I was consistently delivering projects on time, my communication with stakeholders could be improved – specifically, I wasn’t proactively updating them on potential roadblocks. Initially, I felt a bit defensive, but I realized they were right and it was impacting team collaboration. So, I started scheduling brief weekly check-ins with key stakeholders to provide updates, even if there weren't any issues. That shift has significantly improved communication and strengthened relationships.\\\"\", \"total_score\": 0}"]}
