{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786137221728,"level":"log","data":["Response body:","{\"session_id\":230,\"questions\":[{\"question_id\":1130,\"question_order\":1,\"question\":\"Tell me about a time you had to deal with a difficult customer. What specific steps did you take to resolve the situation and what was the outcome?\"},{\"question_id\":1131,\"question_order\":2,\"question\":\"Describe a situation where you successfully motivated a team member who was struggling. What approach did you use, and how did you measure their improvement?\"},{\"question_id\":1132,\"question_order\":3,\"question\":\"Give an example of when you identified a problem within your previous role that wasn’t immediately obvious. How did you bring it to attention, and what actions were taken as a result?\"},{\"question_id\":1133,\"question_order\":4,\"question\":\"Share an instance where you had to make a quick decision with limited information while managing multiple priorities. What was the situation, what factors did you consider, and what was the final outcome?\"},{\"question_id\":1134,\"question_order\":5,\"question\":\"Describe a time you received constructive criticism that challenged your approach or performance. How did you react to the feedback, and what changes did you implement?\"}]}"]}
