{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786216740192,"level":"log","data":["Response body:","{\"answer_id\":78,\"total_score\":11,\"scores\":{\"situation\":6,\"task\":3,\"action\":2,\"result\":0},\"strengths\":[\"The candidate identified a situation requiring teamwork.\"],\"improvements\":[\"The response lacks context. It doesn't explain *what* goal was being achieved, *where* this occurred (e.g., sport, project), or the broader team dynamic.\",\"The candidate fails to articulate their role beyond simply stating 'I needed...'.\",\"There is no description of actions taken to address the issue.\",\"No outcome or result is described.\"],\"feedback\":\"This response is extremely weak and doesn't demonstrate an understanding of the STAR method. It’s a fragmented observation, not a story. The candidate needs to provide significantly more detail to illustrate their teamwork skills.\",\"suggested_answer\":\"\\\"During a recent baseball game, our team was down by one run in the final inning. Our goal was to get a runner on second base to create an opportunity for a hit. I noticed that the pitcher wasn't consistently throwing the pitches called out by the coach, which was impacting our strategy. My role was to communicate directly with the pitcher, reinforcing the signs and ensuring they understood the game plan. The challenge we faced was the pressure of the situation – the pitcher was understandably nervous. To address this, I calmly reiterated the signs, offered encouragement, and focused on visualizing successful throws. Ultimately, we managed to get the pitcher back on track, and he secured the final out, securing the win for our team.\\\"\"}"]}
{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786216740194,"level":"log","data":["STAR evaluation:","{\"answer_id\": 78, \"feedback\": \"This response is extremely weak and doesn't demonstrate an understanding of the STAR method. It’s a fragmented observation, not a story. The candidate needs to provide significantly more detail to illustrate their teamwork skills.\", \"improvements\": [\"The response lacks context. It doesn't explain *what* goal was being achieved, *where* this occurred (e.g., sport, project), or the broader team dynamic.\", \"The candidate fails to articulate their role beyond simply stating 'I needed...'.\", \"There is no description of actions taken to address the issue.\", \"No outcome or result is described.\"], \"scores\": {\"action\": 2, \"result\": 0, \"situation\": 6, \"task\": 3}, \"strengths\": [\"The candidate identified a situation requiring teamwork.\"], \"suggested_answer\": \"\\\"During a recent baseball game, our team was down by one run in the final inning. Our goal was to get a runner on second base to create an opportunity for a hit. I noticed that the pitcher wasn't consistently throwing the pitches called out by the coach, which was impacting our strategy. My role was to communicate directly with the pitcher, reinforcing the signs and ensuring they understood the game plan. The challenge we faced was the pressure of the situation – the pitcher was understandably nervous. To address this, I calmly reiterated the signs, offered encouragement, and focused on visualizing successful throws. Ultimately, we managed to get the pitcher back on track, and he secured the final out, securing the win for our team.\\\"\", \"total_score\": 11}"]}
