{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786216910645,"level":"log","data":["Response body:","{\"answer_id\":81,\"total_score\":21,\"scores\":{\"situation\":6,\"task\":7,\"action\":5,\"result\":3},\"strengths\":[\"The candidate identified a clear situation – a change in pitching strategy.\"],\"improvements\":[\"The response lacks detail about the context of the game. What sport was this? What was the team’s initial strategy?\",\"The candidate only describes their immediate reaction and doesn't elaborate on *how* they adjusted.\",\"There is no mention of the outcome or impact of the change.\"],\"feedback\":\"This answer demonstrates a basic understanding of needing to adapt, but it needs significant development. It’s too brief and lacks crucial context and detail to fully assess the candidate’s ability to handle unexpected changes.\",\"suggested_answer\":\"\\\"During a recent baseball game, our team was relying on a right-handed pitcher to neutralize their strong hitter. However, with one out in the fifth inning, the opposing manager unexpectedly substituted in a left-handed pitcher. Recognizing this shift immediately, I adjusted my approach by focusing on leading off pitches and utilizing the slower speed of the new pitcher to shorten at bats. This resulted in two quick outs and helped us regain control of the game.\\\"\"}"]}
{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786216910645,"level":"log","data":["STAR evaluation:","{\"answer_id\": 81, \"feedback\": \"This answer demonstrates a basic understanding of needing to adapt, but it needs significant development. It’s too brief and lacks crucial context and detail to fully assess the candidate’s ability to handle unexpected changes.\", \"improvements\": [\"The response lacks detail about the context of the game. What sport was this? What was the team’s initial strategy?\", \"The candidate only describes their immediate reaction and doesn't elaborate on *how* they adjusted.\", \"There is no mention of the outcome or impact of the change.\"], \"scores\": {\"action\": 5, \"result\": 3, \"situation\": 6, \"task\": 7}, \"strengths\": [\"The candidate identified a clear situation – a change in pitching strategy.\"], \"suggested_answer\": \"\\\"During a recent baseball game, our team was relying on a right-handed pitcher to neutralize their strong hitter. However, with one out in the fifth inning, the opposing manager unexpectedly substituted in a left-handed pitcher. Recognizing this shift immediately, I adjusted my approach by focusing on leading off pitches and utilizing the slower speed of the new pitcher to shorten at bats. This resulted in two quick outs and helped us regain control of the game.\\\"\", \"total_score\": 21}"]}
