{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786217302303,"level":"log","data":["Response body:","{\"answer_id\":83,\"total_score\":4,\"scores\":{\"situation\":3,\"task\":1,\"action\":0,\"result\":0},\"strengths\":[\"None\"],\"improvements\":[\"The candidate's response is completely inappropriate and demonstrates a severe lack of professionalism. The answer fails to address the question’s intent regarding teamwork and conflict resolution.\",\"The candidate needs significant coaching on appropriate communication and interpersonal skills.\"],\"feedback\":\"This response is entirely unacceptable. It reveals a serious misunderstanding of professional behavior and conflict resolution strategies. Immediate and thorough coaching is required.\",\"suggested_answer\":\"Let me share an example. During a recent project to develop a new marketing campaign, I was working with a teammate named Sarah who had a very different approach than my own. I favored a data-driven strategy, focusing on detailed market research and A/B testing before launching any campaigns. Sarah preferred a more creative, 'big idea' approach, often proposing innovative concepts without extensive analysis. To ensure success, I first took the time to understand her perspective – why she felt so strongly about her ideas. I actively listened to her reasoning and acknowledged the value of creativity in our campaign. Then, we collaboratively developed a plan that combined my analytical skills with her creative vision. We agreed to run a small pilot test for some of her more ambitious concepts, using data to measure their effectiveness before committing to full-scale implementation. This approach allowed us to leverage both our strengths and ultimately created a highly successful marketing campaign.\"}"]}
{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786217302316,"level":"log","data":["STAR evaluation:","{\"answer_id\": 83, \"feedback\": \"This response is entirely unacceptable. It reveals a serious misunderstanding of professional behavior and conflict resolution strategies. Immediate and thorough coaching is required.\", \"improvements\": [\"The candidate's response is completely inappropriate and demonstrates a severe lack of professionalism. The answer fails to address the question’s intent regarding teamwork and conflict resolution.\", \"The candidate needs significant coaching on appropriate communication and interpersonal skills.\"], \"scores\": {\"action\": 0, \"result\": 0, \"situation\": 3, \"task\": 1}, \"strengths\": [\"None\"], \"suggested_answer\": \"Let me share an example. During a recent project to develop a new marketing campaign, I was working with a teammate named Sarah who had a very different approach than my own. I favored a data-driven strategy, focusing on detailed market research and A/B testing before launching any campaigns. Sarah preferred a more creative, 'big idea' approach, often proposing innovative concepts without extensive analysis. To ensure success, I first took the time to understand her perspective – why she felt so strongly about her ideas. I actively listened to her reasoning and acknowledged the value of creativity in our campaign. Then, we collaboratively developed a plan that combined my analytical skills with her creative vision. We agreed to run a small pilot test for some of her more ambitious concepts, using data to measure their effectiveness before committing to full-scale implementation. This approach allowed us to leverage both our strengths and ultimately created a highly successful marketing campaign.\", \"total_score\": 4}"]}
