{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1786236762677,"level":"log","data":["Response body:","{\"session_id\":295,\"questions\":[{\"question_id\":1455,\"question_order\":1,\"question\":\"Tell me about a time you encountered a significant challenge while developing an ML model. What specific steps did you take to diagnose the problem and ultimately resolve it?\"},{\"question_id\":1456,\"question_order\":2,\"question\":\"Describe a situation where you had to explain a complex technical concept related to machine learning to someone with limited technical expertise. How did you tailor your communication, and what was the outcome?\"},{\"question_id\":1457,\"question_order\":3,\"question\":\"Share an example of a time when you identified an opportunity to improve the performance or efficiency of an existing ML model or pipeline. What changes did you propose, and how did you measure their impact?\"},{\"question_id\":1458,\"question_order\":4,\"question\":\"Describe a project where collaboration with other engineers (e.g., data scientists, software developers) was crucial for success. What were your specific contributions, and how did you navigate any potential conflicts or differing opinions?\"},{\"question_id\":1459,\"question_order\":5,\"question\":\"Tell me about a time you made an error in your work that had significant consequences. How did you handle the situation, what steps did you take to prevent similar errors in the future, and what did you learn from this experience?\"}]}"]}
